---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalHeader from '../components/LegalHeader.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy">
  <main class="bg-white">
    <LegalHeader lang="en" />
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-text">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted mb-10">
        <strong>Last updated:</strong> October 4, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <p>
          This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>Tenants10 KIG</strong> ("Tenants10", "we")
          uses cookies and similar technologies (such as local storage) on tenants10.com and in
          the Tenants10 web application, and how you can control them. It should be read
          alongside our <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary font-medium">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">1. What are cookies?</h2>
          <p>
            Cookies are small text files placed on your device by a website. "Similar
            technologies" includes browser local storage and session storage, which our web
            application uses in the same way as a cookie for the purposes of this Policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">2. Categories of cookies we use</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
            <li>
              <strong>Strictly necessary</strong> (always active) — keep you logged in, remember
              your session, protect against cross-site request forgery, and remember basic
              preferences such as your selected language. The Service cannot function without
              these, so they cannot be switched off.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Functional</strong> — remember non-essential preferences (such as a
              collapsed sidebar or a chosen view) to make the Service more convenient to use.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Analytics</strong> (website only, where enabled) — help us understand how
              visitors use tenants10.com, in aggregate, so we can improve it. These are only set
              with your consent on the public website.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not use third-party advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">3. Your choices</h2>
          <p>
            When you first visit tenants10.com, you can choose which non-essential cookie
            categories to allow via the cookie banner. You can change your choice at any time by
            clearing the "tenants10-cookie-consent" entry in your browser's site data, which will
            show the banner again, or by adjusting your browser's own cookie settings. Blocking
            strictly necessary cookies will prevent the website and app from working correctly,
            including staying logged in.
          </p>
          <p>
            The Tenants10 web application (workspace.tenants10.com) only sets the strictly
            necessary cookies/local storage needed to keep you signed in and remember your
            settings — no analytics or advertising cookies are set there.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this Cookie Policy? Contact
            <a href="mailto:support@tenants10.com" class="text-primary font-medium">
              support@tenants10.com
            </a>
            .
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
